 and expression in tango.    Level 3 Tango Classes are all about going beyond the steps and focusing on how to create feelings and effects through the tango technique.     (teachers approval is needed for entry to this level)    At Tango Melbourne, we place dancing at the top of the pile. Often, schools talk about what is right and wrong. We like to teach what is possible and let you choose how to use our tools.    Tango Melbourne Level 3 classes explore the feelings of dancing and give you the tools to express yourself in tango dance.    Come and grow your tango and experience the highest level of improvised partner dance.    Followed by PRACTICA 9 - 10.30 pm    Cost options:    Payment can be made after class so you can choose the option that best suits you.    Class casual $25    &nbsp;    Memberships:    Basic: $36 pw. It gives you access to all live group classes, online LIVESTREAM and recorded classes (over 150), free Practica entry, and 50% off on events. The Membership can be cancelled or put on hold anytime; you must give two weeks' notice.    VIP: $55 pw Includes the above as well as one private per month and free entry into all Milongas    &nbsp;    5 Class Pass $105 ($21 per class)    &nbsp;    10  Class Pass $190 ($19 per class)    &nbsp;    Practica $10 casual (free for members and class attendees)    &nbsp;    Milonga is $20 for casual, $10 for members and class attendees, and free for VIP members.    &nbsp;    Privates Lessons:    Privates are available on weekdays and weekends; for details, contact us by email or phone at 0411083501    &nbsp;","longDescription":null,"eventType":"online","category":null,"userId":1,"startDate":"2025-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","date":null,"startDateTime":null,"endDateTime":null,"timezone":"UTC","isRecurring":false,"recurring":null,"recurrenceRule":null,"location":"I.AM.DANCE Studio","venue":null,"venueName":null,"address":null,"city":"Melbourne","country":null,"latitude":null,"longitude":