e other 2 styles are used every 4 or for tandas (groups of songs)    Tango Vals is a dance in groups of 3 like other valses however, in Tango Vals you will be using your Argentine Tango ideas to make it all happen.    Milonga is where tango started.  It is a dance based in groups of 2 and is the 'fun' more folk style of tango.    Vals / Milonga is all about the fun, getting involved, and discovering more about tango.    Cost options:    Payment can be made after attending class so that you can choose the option that best suits you.    Class casual $25    &nbsp;    Memberships:    Basic: $36 pw. Gives you access to all live group classes, as well as online LIVESTREAM and recorded classes (there are over 150), free Practica entry, and 50% off on events. The Membership can be cancelled or put on hold at any time, you just need to give two weeks notice.    VIP: $55 pw Includes the above as well as 1 private per month and free entry into all Milongas    &nbsp;    5 Class Pass $105 ($21 per class)    &nbsp;    10  Class Pass $190 ($19 per class)    &nbsp;    Practica $10 casual (free for members and class attendees)    &nbsp;    Milonga $20 casual, $10 for members and class attendees, free for VIP members    &nbsp;    Privates Lessons:    Privates available weekdays and weekends, for details, contact us by email or phone 0411083501    &nbsp;    ","longDescription":null,"eventType":"online","category":null,"userId":1,"startDate":"2025-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","date":null,"startDateTime":null,"endDateTime":null,"timezone":"UTC","isRecurring":false,"recurring":null,"recurrenceRule":null,"location":"I.AM.DANCE Studio","venue":null,"venueName":null,"address":null,"city":"Melbourne","country":null,"latitude":null,"longitude":null,"isOnline":false,"onlineLink":null,"meetingUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://i0.wp.com/tangoclub.melbourne/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/download-10-e1746830557475.jpg?fit=700%2C393&#038;ssl=1","coverImage":null,"mediaUrls":nu