ng partner – anyone can join, even solo dancers.    &nbsp;    For more information please contact us at:    &nbsp;    &lt;mailto:takes2au@gmail.com&gt;    instagram.com/takes2au &lt;http://instagram.com/takes2au&gt;    facebook.com/takes2au &lt;http://facebook.com/takes2au&gt;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    Join us at Takes2 Tango Class for an unforgettable evening of music, laughter, and, of course, tango!    &nbsp;","longDescription":null,"eventType":"milonga","category":null,"userId":1,"startDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","date":null,"startDateTime":null,"endDateTime":null,"timezone":"UTC","isRecurring":false,"recurring":null,"recurrenceRule":null,"location":"Studio Take Care","venue":null,"venueName":null,"address":null,"city":"Melbourne","country":null,"latitude":null,"longitude":null,"isOnline":false,"onlineLink":null,"meetingUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://i0.wp.com/tangoclub.melbourne/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/classes-flyer-e1725841099584.png?fit=750%2C375&#038;ssl=1","coverImage":null,"mediaUrls":null,"organizerId":null,"coOrganizers":null,"groupId":21,"maxAttendees":null,"currentAttendees":0,"waitlistEnabled":false,"waitlistCount":0,"isPaid":false,"isFree":true,"price":null,"currency":"USD","ticketUrl":null,"ticketLink":null,"stripePriceId":null,"visibility":"public","requiresApproval":false,"allowGuestPlusOne":false,"allowPhotos":true,"allowComments":true,"musicStyle":null,"danceStyles":null,"djName":null,"tags":null,"dressCode":null,"ageRestriction":null,"wheelchairAccessible":true,"parkingAvailable":false,"status":"published","cancellationReason":null,"approvedBy":null,"approvedAt":null,"rejectionReason":null,"adminNotes":null,"viewCount":0,"shareCount":0,"sourceName":null,"sourceUrl":null,"externalSourceId":null,"scrapedEventId":null,"organizerText":null,"djText":null,"teacherText":null,"performerText":null,"seriesId":null,"createdAt":"2025-11-25T18:46:54.003Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-25T18:46:54.003Z","publishedAt":null},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"Elena Rodriguez","username":"elena_tango","profileImage":null,"isVerified":false},"attendeeCount":0},{"event":{"id":1282,"title":"TangoMelbourne &#8211; Tango 1 &#038; 1.5","slug":null,"description":"Tango beginner classes - Tango 1      Dancing Tango can be taught in a way that makes you fail over and over again. Tango Melbourne beginner classes will get you to do things within moments that you never thought possible. We love the dance and with our passion and your joy, we will get you out and dancing socially within weeks.      Tango Level 1.5  Push your tango a bit further.  Tango level 1.5 is a combination of Movement sequences, Tango Vals and Tango Milonga.    Sequences are some of the most common and usable sequences so that you are ready to go out and move with others without having to worry about knowing what to do.    In the Vals / Milonga Classes you will learn the way to dance to Vals &amp; Milonga.    At a Tango Social event (also called a milonga) the music is divided into 3 types.  Tango, Vals, and Milonga (the musical style, not the social event...yes we know it's confusing). Although Tango is the majority of the music played the other 2 styles are used every 4 or for tandas (groups of songs)    Tango Vals is a dance in groups of 3 like other valses however, in Tango Vals you will be using your Argentine Tango ideas to make it all happen.    Milonga is where tango started.  It is a dance based in groups of 2 and is the 'fun' more folk style of tango.    Tango 1 - time 7 - 8 pm    Tango 1.5 - time 6 - 7 pm    Entry via Kerr St    Free on street parking.    The 86 tram stops just outside the venue.","longDescription":null,"eventType":"social","category":null,"userId":1,"startDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","date":null,"startDateTime":null,"endDateTime":null,"timezone":"UTC","isRecurring":false,"recurring":null,"recurrenceRule":null,"location":"I.AM.DANCE Studio","venue":null,"venueName":null,"address":null,"city":"Melbourne","country":null,"latitude":null,"longitude":null,"isOnline":false,"onlineLink":null,"meetingUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://i0.wp.com/tangoclub.melbourne/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/download-10-e1746830557475.jpg?fit=700%2C393&#038;ssl=1","coverImage":null,"mediaUrls":null,"organizerId":null,"coOrganizers":null,"groupId":21,"maxAttendees":null,"currentAttendees":0,"waitlistEnabled":false,"waitlistCount":0,"isPaid":false,"isFree":true,"price":null,"currency":"USD","ticketUrl":null,"ticketLink":null,"stripePriceId":null,"visibility":"public","requiresApproval":false,"allowGuestPlusOne":false,"allowPhotos":true,"allowComments":true,"musicStyle":null,"danceStyles":null,"djName":null,"tags":null,"dressCode":null,"ageRestriction":null,"wheelchairAccessible":true,"parkingAvailable":false,"status":"published","cancellationReason":null,"approvedBy":null,"approvedAt":null,"rejectionReason":null,"adminNotes":null,"viewCount":0,"shareCount":0,"sourceName":null,"sourceUrl":null,"externalSourceId":null,"scrapedEventId":null,"organizerText":null,"djText":null,"teacherText":null,"performerText":null,"seriesId":null,"createdAt":"2025-11-25T18:46:46.976Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-25T18:46:46.976Z","publishedAt":null},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"Elena Rodriguez","username":"elena_tango","profileImage":null,"isVerified":false},"attendeeCount":0},{"event":{"id":1388,"title":"TangoMelbourne &#8211; Tango 2","slug":null,"description":"Go beyond the fundamentals and push your art and expression in tango.    Level 2 Tango Classes are all about going beyond the steps and focusing on how to create feelings and effects through the tango technique.     (teachers approval is needed for entry to this level)    At Tango Melbourne we place dancing at the top of the pile. Often schools talk about what is right and wrong. We like to teach what is possible and let you choose how you will use the tools we provide.    Tango Melbourne Level 2 classes explore deeper the feelings of dancing and provide you the tools to really express yourself in the dance of tango    Come and grow your tango and experience the highest level of improvised partner dance.    Followed by PARCTICA  9 - 10.30 pm    Cost options:    Payment can be made after attending class so that you can choose the option that best suits you.    Class casual $25    &nbsp;    Memberships:    Basic: $36 pw. Gives you access to all live group classes, as well as online LIVESTREAM and recorded classes (there are over 150), free Practica entry, and 50% off on events. The Membership can be canceled or put on hold at any time, you just need to give two weeks' notice.    VIP: $55 pw Includes the above as well as 1 private per month and free entry into all Milongas    &nbsp;    5 Class Pass $105 ($21 per class)    &nbsp;    10  Class Pass $190 ($19 per class)    &nbsp;    Practica $10 casual (free for members and class attendees)    &nbsp;    Milonga is $20 for casual, $10 for members and class attendees, and free for VIP members    &nbsp;    Privates Lessons:    Privates are available on weekdays and weekends, for details, contact us by email or phone at 0411083501    &nbsp;","longDescription":null,"eventType":"online","category":null,"userId":1,"startDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","date":null,"startDateTime":null,"endDateTime":null,"timezone":"UTC","isRecurring":false,"recurring":null,"recurrenceRule":null,"location":"I.AM.DANCE Studio","venue":null,"venueName":null,"address":null,"city":"Melbourne","country":null,"latitude":null,"longitude":null,"isOnline":false,"onlineLink":null,"meetingUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://i0.wp.com/tangoclub.melbourne/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/download-10-e1746830557475.jpg?fit=700%2C393&#038;ssl=1","coverImage":null,"mediaUrls":null,"organizerId":null,"coOrganizers":null,"groupId":21,"maxAttendees":null,"currentAttendees":0,"waitlistEnabled":false,"waitlistCount":0,"isPaid":false,"isFree":true,"price":null,"currency